    "message": "Find the active actions at fork and resume without reading every record (stage B3)\n\nThe runner's __init__ read every agent_action_lifecycle record to rebuild the active\nactions, which made about 176,000 record objects at each fork or resume near day 7. The\nRust EventLog now keeps each lifecycle record's agent and transition as it is added and\nreturns only the records that decide the result, in the order a full pass would insert\nthe agents.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
