    },
    "message": "Reuse more of the last save's work in each Checkpoint save (stage B3)\n\nThe restore check reads only the new KPI samples and compares only the model_state\nhistory entries not compared at this save; a frame's care history reads only new\nrecords; the EventLog's item bytes are fetched only for new records; canonical JSON\nuses the Rust encoder when it can; all new chunks of a save are checked for sensitive\ncontent in one parallel call. A changed or new item is still read and checked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
